                                "sense_id": "ea4aba25-737a-3771-ae35-9080bce4e0eb",
                                "text": "This section is perfectly straight until the top of the rise is reached, where a 10 m.p.h. limit board gives warning of a sharp curve, and an ungated public road crossing, protected by cattle guards of the usual light railway pattern."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bef57d58-2f18-4e5a-91e5-57fce0f73c7c",
                                "sense_id": "ea4aba25-737a-3771-ae35-9080bce4e0eb",
                                "text": "Tender engines cannot be used on this line because ungated level crossings inhibit crews from tender-first running and there is no turntable."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "12efb79e-1af1-4b5e-8768-a461aee4e789",
                                "sense_id": "ea4aba25-737a-3771-ae35-9080bce4e0eb",
                                "text": "The number of ungated crossings protected by automatic flashing lights is about 300 and some 400 hand-operated crossings are equipped with red or yellow flashing warning lights."
